    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but he's really resistant to going to the hospital and he’s just being stubborn. he says he just feels dizzy. if i give him like 2000mg of tylenol all at once it should bring it down right? i just want him to be able to sleep. if the fever goes down, the confusion will go away too, right?",
